cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use RepoTrials in an evaluation, cite the exact software revision (or
  source-archive SHA-256) and include the evaluated task IDs and run-group
  identifiers in your report.
title: RepoTrials
type: software
authors:
  - name: PozziTiv4ik
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/PozziTiv4ik/Repo-Trials
url: https://github.com/PozziTiv4ik/Repo-Trials
abstract: >-
  RepoTrials is a local-first tool for mining a repository's Git history into
  private coding-agent tasks with BASE/RED/GOLD validation,
  hidden verifier artifacts, command-based agent execution, and structured
  reports.
keywords:
  - software engineering agents
  - coding agents
  - benchmark generation
  - repository mining
  - reproducible evaluation
